    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00145_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Use something else.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00146_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You're right. It can't be good for my skin.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00147_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "That should be the least of your worries.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00148_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "It is humanity's greatest weapon and must not be used out of combat.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00149_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "As such, please take care not to accidentally say your Seraph Code.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00150_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Question for ya: Why is my code \"My legend begins now\"? I already made my mark and retired, so it sounds super lame, like I'm a musician past her prime, begging for attention.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00151_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "We selected the statements that would best bolster your morale.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00152_TTojo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "And how did you determine that?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00153_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "They were assigned after your three-month assessment period.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00154_TTojo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "On what evidence? I've never said this in my life.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00155_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "On account of the fact that you summoned your Seraphim.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_01_06_01_Novel_00156_TTojo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Indeed!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
